WEBVTT

01:49.810 --> 01:54.990
[A Dream Within A Dream]

01:55.030 --> 01:57.950
[Episode 32]

02:03.510 --> 02:05.040
What's the purpose of you

02:05.760 --> 02:07.090
bringing me here today?

02:09.430 --> 02:10.710
I brought you here

02:11.910 --> 02:14.110
to make a vow under the matchmaker tree.

02:16.120 --> 02:16.910
Song Yimeng,

02:18.079 --> 02:19.750
whatever troubles you

02:20.120 --> 02:21.850
or frightens you in the future,

02:21.870 --> 02:23.600
I will resolve them all for you.

02:24.280 --> 02:25.310
And rest assured,

02:25.870 --> 02:28.310
I will take good care of you and
the Song family,

02:28.310 --> 02:30.840
and I will never let you down
in this lifetime.

02:37.840 --> 02:38.840
Didn't you say

02:39.630 --> 02:41.470
you never believed in deities?

02:43.150 --> 02:44.210
Since you believe,

02:44.470 --> 02:45.730
then I'll believe too.

02:54.360 --> 02:56.560
What's the point of believing, anyway?

02:56.560 --> 02:58.220
The fate written in the script

02:58.520 --> 02:59.850
still can't be changed.

03:04.520 --> 03:05.320
Can the script

03:06.150 --> 03:07.430
really not be changed?

03:08.430 --> 03:09.290
Think about it,

03:10.280 --> 03:12.210
in that so-called script of yours,

03:12.520 --> 03:14.380
I was supposed to be a God of Death.

03:15.270 --> 03:16.620
But look at me now,

03:17.910 --> 03:19.170
am I still that person?

03:19.590 --> 03:20.400
I...

03:22.280 --> 03:23.079
You're right.

03:23.870 --> 03:25.730
You stood up for the Nightwalker,

03:25.900 --> 03:27.340
for all those people,

03:27.400 --> 03:29.000
and exposed Chancellor Gao.

03:29.360 --> 03:30.360
This proves

03:31.240 --> 03:32.640
you've already changed.

03:34.310 --> 03:34.910
But...

03:34.910 --> 03:36.240
Not only have I changed,

03:36.400 --> 03:37.800
others have changed too.

03:38.280 --> 03:39.900
Nan Rui no longer fears me,

03:40.470 --> 03:41.600
and even His Majesty

03:42.150 --> 03:44.550
has passed the crown prince position
to me.

03:45.310 --> 03:46.329
So you see,

03:47.070 --> 03:48.770
if the people in the script can change,

03:48.770 --> 03:51.329
why can't the ending of the story
change too?

03:59.329 --> 04:01.260
The reason I brought you here today

04:01.910 --> 04:03.680
is to make one last effort,

04:05.630 --> 04:07.840
and to tell you how I feel one last time.

04:19.209 --> 04:21.170
I know you still have concerns,

04:22.430 --> 04:23.760
but I'm willing to wait.

04:44.860 --> 04:45.900
I understand.

04:48.240 --> 04:49.040
Don't worry.

04:51.600 --> 04:54.730
I'll ask His Majesty to cancel
the engagement tomorrow.

05:04.460 --> 05:05.170
Nan Heng,

05:06.600 --> 05:07.920
although I don't know

05:09.070 --> 05:10.820
how this will end,

05:12.560 --> 05:13.880
this time,

05:14.830 --> 05:15.680
I'm willing

05:16.510 --> 05:17.710
to be brave once more.

05:25.310 --> 05:26.070
Are-

05:26.560 --> 05:27.360
Are you saying

05:28.260 --> 05:29.160
you agreed?

05:34.590 --> 05:41.070
[Iconic Scenes in the Script]

05:50.420 --> 05:54.450
[5. A three-way stabbing on
the wedding day]

06:09.690 --> 06:16.040
[5. A three-way stabbing on
the wedding day]

06:27.600 --> 06:28.390
Nan Heng.

06:29.020 --> 06:31.080
I want to discuss something with you.

06:32.110 --> 06:33.909
Can we skip the wedding ceremony

06:34.070 --> 06:36.130
and just get a marriage certificate?

06:36.550 --> 06:38.880
What do you mean just get the certificate?

06:39.930 --> 06:43.490
I mean skipping all those wedding
processions

06:43.720 --> 06:44.680
and directly...

06:45.430 --> 06:46.800
D-Directly

06:48.790 --> 06:50.120
enter the nuptial room?

06:51.920 --> 06:53.440
That's not what I meant.

06:54.360 --> 06:55.159
No.

06:56.240 --> 06:57.620
I'm just

06:57.750 --> 06:59.810
worried about how the plot will develop.

06:59.810 --> 07:01.480
According to the storyline,

07:01.630 --> 07:03.480
during our wedding ceremony,

07:03.480 --> 07:05.590
Chu Guihong will definitely appear
to obstruct it.

07:05.590 --> 07:06.550
The two of you

07:06.630 --> 07:08.270
will inevitably argue.

07:09.340 --> 07:10.790
I remember now.

07:11.200 --> 07:12.270
Is it the

07:12.700 --> 07:14.860
"Three-way stabbing

07:15.270 --> 07:16.400
on the wedding day"?

07:20.920 --> 07:23.250
You really do have a photographic memory.

07:23.870 --> 07:25.120
I could understand

07:25.600 --> 07:27.310
the "wedding day" part.

07:28.750 --> 07:30.950
What does "three-way-stabbing" mean?

07:31.960 --> 07:33.860
"Three-way stabbing" means...

07:34.400 --> 07:41.180
[A Dream of Qingning;
Scene 18, Episode 32]

07:36.540 --> 07:37.630
If you hurt her,

07:38.060 --> 07:38.970
you die!

07:42.390 --> 07:43.530
If you hurt him,

07:42.800 --> 07:46.000
♪ Bow to the parents ♪

07:43.760 --> 07:44.890
you die!

07:46.870 --> 07:47.680
Today,

07:48.120 --> 07:49.450
we all die!

07:54.470 --> 07:56.850
♪ Bow to each other ♪

08:01.240 --> 08:02.720
So to avoid all this,

08:02.720 --> 08:04.120
can we just skip it,

08:04.150 --> 08:04.910
please?

08:08.190 --> 08:08.610
Wait,

08:08.870 --> 08:11.120
I understand him stabbing me,

08:11.500 --> 08:12.950
but you stabbing him?

08:13.070 --> 08:14.640
And me stabbing you?

08:15.190 --> 08:16.680
Why would I stab you?

08:16.700 --> 08:18.460
I know it sounds really absurd,

08:19.310 --> 08:21.570
but that's exactly what the script says.

08:25.190 --> 08:27.050
This script is truly ridiculous.

08:30.840 --> 08:32.360
Whenever I'm in danger,

08:32.360 --> 08:34.690
you would come to save me uncontrollably.

08:35.039 --> 08:37.740
What would happen if the mechanism where
iconic scenes must happen

08:37.580 --> 08:41.460
[Script Rule]

08:38.150 --> 08:39.150
and the mechanism where

08:39.150 --> 08:42.280
the male lead must save the female lead
in times of danger

08:42.390 --> 08:43.720
occur simultaneously?

08:46.790 --> 08:47.600
What's wrong?

08:49.910 --> 08:50.720
Nothing.

08:51.510 --> 08:52.320
Don't worry.

08:52.620 --> 08:54.220
I'll take care of everything

08:54.480 --> 08:55.270
from now on.

08:55.670 --> 08:56.480
As for you,

08:56.710 --> 08:59.110
just stay home and prepare for
our wedding.

09:08.110 --> 09:09.980
You want to let Chu Guihong

09:10.010 --> 09:12.870
lead the Qianyu Army to Pingrong
for garrison duty?

09:13.720 --> 09:14.510
Yes.

09:15.960 --> 09:18.290
Since I have been appointed Crown Prince,

09:19.000 --> 09:20.460
according to traditions,

09:20.510 --> 09:21.770
the capital's defence

09:22.320 --> 09:24.320
should be transferred to the Xuanjia Army.

09:24.320 --> 09:26.450
If the Qianyu Army continues to guard,

09:26.750 --> 09:28.150
it might cause conflict.

09:29.510 --> 09:31.240
Stop pretending in front of me.

09:31.320 --> 09:33.240
When have you ever asked for my decree

09:33.240 --> 09:35.240
for matters other than Song Yimeng?

09:38.670 --> 09:40.470
I dare not deceive Your Majesty.

09:40.960 --> 09:41.960
It's only because

09:42.310 --> 09:44.910
Chu Guihong and Song Yimeng were once
engaged,

09:45.120 --> 09:46.660
and Chu Guihong has been dwelling

09:46.660 --> 09:47.940
on this matter.

09:48.570 --> 09:50.100
My wedding is approaching.

09:50.600 --> 09:52.260
Having him stationed far away

09:52.300 --> 09:53.960
would be better for everyone.

10:04.080 --> 10:04.880
I understand.

10:07.840 --> 10:08.630
All rise.

10:10.670 --> 10:11.800
Thank Your Majesty.

10:15.300 --> 10:16.700
How is your relationship

10:17.270 --> 10:19.150
with Rui lately?

10:20.480 --> 10:21.400
I have always

10:21.550 --> 10:23.480
had limited interaction with Rui.

10:25.030 --> 10:27.030
Did Your Majesty asks this question

10:27.320 --> 10:28.320
out of concern that

10:28.320 --> 10:29.630
if Chu Guihong is transferred,

10:29.630 --> 10:31.490
it might cause resentment in Rui?

10:33.120 --> 10:35.440
Rui is very close to his cousin,

10:36.120 --> 10:38.040
and he's already disappointed

10:38.120 --> 10:39.980
about not becoming Crown Prince.

10:40.240 --> 10:42.840
If he also loses Chu Guihong's
companionship,

10:42.870 --> 10:43.870
I fear

10:43.970 --> 10:45.630
he might not be able to bear it.

10:48.480 --> 10:50.670
Your Majesty's consideration is thorough.

10:50.670 --> 10:51.480
This matter

10:51.840 --> 10:54.240
should indeed be discussed with Rui first.

10:56.840 --> 10:58.030
I was thoughtless.

10:59.600 --> 11:01.460
Please forgive me, Your Majesty.

11:09.670 --> 11:10.840
What a coincidence.

11:12.630 --> 11:14.630
Rui also came to see me today.

11:15.150 --> 11:16.150
He also suggested

11:16.670 --> 11:19.200
that I give Chu Guihong a new task

11:19.510 --> 11:21.710
and transfer him away from the capital.

11:23.510 --> 11:24.730
This time,

11:25.080 --> 11:26.670
Rui has the same idea as you.

11:27.630 --> 11:30.270
He's worried that if Chu Guihong
stays in the capital,

11:30.270 --> 11:31.390
he'll be trapped by his demons,

11:31.390 --> 11:32.510
obsessed with the past,

11:32.510 --> 11:34.040
and unable to move forward.

11:38.270 --> 11:39.440
If that's the case,

11:40.060 --> 11:42.190
Rui has indeed become much more mature

11:42.240 --> 11:43.600
as compared to before.

11:44.510 --> 11:46.040
I am humbled by comparison.

11:46.480 --> 11:48.280
Being sarcastic again, are you?

11:50.150 --> 11:51.080
I wouldn't dare.

11:53.120 --> 11:54.550
It's rare for you brothers

11:54.550 --> 11:55.950
to have the same opinion.

11:56.550 --> 11:57.950
I will grant your wishes,

11:58.480 --> 12:01.080
and have Chu Guihong depart for Pingrong
soon.

12:03.240 --> 12:04.640
Thank you, Your Majesty.

12:06.280 --> 12:08.230
Nan Heng is truly going too far.

12:08.750 --> 12:09.750
He stole Yimeng from me

12:09.750 --> 12:11.220
and manipulated my cousin.

12:11.220 --> 12:12.270
His uncle

12:12.270 --> 12:14.290
killed my father and brothers.

12:14.630 --> 12:16.330
Why is he appointed the Crown Prince,

12:16.330 --> 12:17.790
marrying my fiancée,

12:17.790 --> 12:18.910
and still tries to completely destroy me

12:18.910 --> 12:19.790
by driving me out of the capital?

12:19.790 --> 12:20.630
How dare he!

12:22.240 --> 12:23.030
General.

12:24.000 --> 12:25.510
This is His Majesty's decree.

12:25.510 --> 12:26.750
So what?

12:27.060 --> 12:28.240
How do we know Nan Heng

12:28.240 --> 12:29.770
hasn't used some devious scheme

12:29.770 --> 12:31.500
to deceive His Majesty as well?

12:33.620 --> 12:35.550
The tide has turned against us now.

12:36.000 --> 12:37.930
Us lying low in Pingrong for a few years

12:37.930 --> 12:39.570
might not be such a bad thing.

12:40.480 --> 12:42.090
When things cool down,

12:42.270 --> 12:43.680
we'll fight our way back to the capital

12:43.680 --> 12:44.640
and rise again.

12:46.000 --> 12:48.540
Him forcing me out of the capital now

12:49.150 --> 12:50.720
shows that he clearly doesn't want me

12:50.720 --> 12:52.980
to appear at Yimeng's wedding ceremony.

12:53.890 --> 12:55.110
But this time,

12:56.210 --> 12:58.640
I won't let his scheme succeed.

13:01.060 --> 13:06.010
[Three days later,]

13:06.040 --> 13:10.810
[Yan Gate]

13:10.390 --> 13:10.920
General.

13:11.490 --> 13:12.790
It's time to depart.

13:13.480 --> 13:14.740
The Eighteenth Prince

13:15.120 --> 13:16.580
probably won't be coming.

13:19.840 --> 13:20.710
Shall we

13:20.920 --> 13:21.940
set off then?

13:25.360 --> 13:26.160
Let's depart.

13:26.220 --> 13:30.500
[Yan Gate]

13:27.270 --> 13:28.340
Let's depart.

13:34.870 --> 13:35.950
Guihong,

13:37.320 --> 13:38.590
take care.

13:39.570 --> 13:41.750
[Yan Gate]

13:46.640 --> 13:48.120
Listen carefully, you two.

13:48.120 --> 13:49.930
You must keep a close eye on Chu Guihong.

13:49.930 --> 13:51.720
Don't let him return to the capital
under any circumstances,

13:51.720 --> 13:54.580
lest he ruins the Chief Master's
wedding ceremony.

13:54.670 --> 13:55.780
Aren't you going?

13:57.320 --> 13:58.120
Me?

14:09.490 --> 14:13.470
[Spirit tablet of the late
Duchess of Anping, Wang Nianmei]

14:11.840 --> 14:12.630
Mother.

14:15.830 --> 14:17.150
To be precise,

14:17.840 --> 14:19.150
I should call you

14:19.950 --> 14:21.470
Song Yimeng's mother.

14:21.700 --> 14:25.990
[Spirit tablet of the late
Duchess of Anping, Wang Nianmei]

14:22.460 --> 14:24.660
Father said your greatest wish in life

14:24.840 --> 14:26.150
was to see Song Yimeng

14:26.480 --> 14:27.810
marry into a good family

14:28.750 --> 14:30.880
and live a prosperous, peaceful life.

14:32.550 --> 14:33.690
But,

14:33.960 --> 14:35.150
I'm truly sorry.

14:36.030 --> 14:37.750
I couldn't fulfil your wish

14:38.480 --> 14:39.880
of marrying Chu Guihong.

14:40.670 --> 14:41.480
However,

14:41.660 --> 14:42.660
even so,

14:43.630 --> 14:44.830
please watch over her

14:45.960 --> 14:47.510
from heaven.

14:56.390 --> 14:57.840
My parents

15:01.000 --> 15:02.480
are in heaven too.

15:07.790 --> 15:08.600
Mother,

15:10.440 --> 15:11.840
if you happen to meet

15:12.670 --> 15:14.440
my parents there,

15:16.840 --> 15:17.670
please

15:18.440 --> 15:19.970
tell them something for me.

15:21.910 --> 15:22.840
Please tell them

15:25.390 --> 15:26.870
that their daughter

15:29.790 --> 15:31.240
has grown up now.

15:33.790 --> 15:36.750
♪ If frost etched traces of weariness ♪

15:34.600 --> 15:35.480
Song Xiaoyu

15:36.840 --> 15:38.270
is getting married tomorrow.

15:38.250 --> 15:40.260
♪ If surging clouds hid the stars ♪

15:41.510 --> 15:45.220
[Laiyi House]

15:42.070 --> 15:44.730
♪ The gaze you once cast upon me ♪

15:42.910 --> 15:44.440
Perhaps in their hearts,

15:45.600 --> 15:47.440
this isn't the best decision,

15:45.890 --> 15:48.580
♪ Does it still remember love and hate? ♪

15:49.790 --> 15:51.390
but please ask them to trust me.

15:49.880 --> 15:52.620
♪ If the rising wind scatters the dust ♪

15:52.680 --> 15:59.780
[Persistence]

15:52.990 --> 15:54.320
This is the bravest decision

15:53.960 --> 15:55.940
♪ If every dream must be awakened ♪

15:55.630 --> 15:57.360
I've ever made in my life.

15:57.960 --> 15:59.080
Because here,

15:57.980 --> 16:00.680
♪ How much of the past can we recognize? ♪

15:59.730 --> 16:01.670
I have friends who take care of me
in every way,

16:01.640 --> 16:04.340
♪ In a single thought lies tenderness ♪

16:02.320 --> 16:04.520
a father who stands up for his daughter,

16:05.000 --> 16:07.440
and a sister and Madam who treat me
like family.

16:07.320 --> 16:13.960
♪ Look at the vast heavens,
letting rain fall, indifferent to all ♪

16:08.730 --> 16:09.530
And of course,

16:10.240 --> 16:12.560
there's also Nan Heng

16:12.630 --> 16:14.510
who put all my concerns to rest.

16:15.200 --> 16:16.000
Yimeng,

16:15.450 --> 16:21.860
♪ Watch how time quietly
waits for stories to take root ♪

16:16.270 --> 16:17.910
if Nan Heng mistreats you,

16:18.790 --> 16:21.310
the Crown Prince's mansion is only
about ten li from home,

16:21.310 --> 16:23.460
I'll personally come to bring you back.

16:22.690 --> 16:29.680
♪ Look at the way you're going,
destiny has it all planned out ♪

16:24.320 --> 16:27.210
The auspicious hour has arrived,

16:27.440 --> 16:29.030
here comes

16:29.080 --> 16:32.150
the bride!

16:30.780 --> 16:40.610
♪ We lead remarkable lives
in this mundane world ♪

16:46.800 --> 16:53.520
♪ Look at the sky, flowers bloom
and fragrance fills the air ♪

16:54.910 --> 17:01.540
♪ The sound of heartbeats
resonates in the passing time ♪

16:56.610 --> 16:58.740
[Song Residence]

17:02.600 --> 17:09.369
♪ Look at the way you're going,
destiny has it all planned out ♪

17:10.720 --> 17:21.480
♪ We lead remarkable lives
in this mundane world ♪

17:18.920 --> 17:22.300
[Laiyun Inn, Front Door]

17:28.109 --> 17:29.700
It's already dawn,

17:29.750 --> 17:31.880
why is there still no news of activity?

17:34.400 --> 17:35.200
The back door.

17:37.070 --> 17:37.880
Right.

17:39.270 --> 17:40.070
Shangguan.

17:41.000 --> 17:41.800
The back door.

17:44.010 --> 17:45.010
Let's depart.

17:44.210 --> 17:47.250
[Laiyun Inn, Back Door]

18:23.240 --> 18:25.230
So this is what it feels like

18:25.400 --> 18:26.860
to marry someone you love.

18:27.790 --> 18:29.960
No wonder everyone loves weddings.

18:30.160 --> 18:32.550
Life does need some sense of ceremony.

18:34.310 --> 18:35.970
Even if something goes wrong,

18:36.200 --> 18:38.130
I won't let anything happen to you.

19:00.880 --> 19:01.680
Chu Guihong.

19:02.720 --> 19:04.030
You came after all.

19:08.960 --> 19:11.290
Wasn't Chu Guihong transferred
out of the capital by Nan Heng?

19:11.290 --> 19:12.780
Why is he back?

19:13.270 --> 19:14.000
Could it be

19:14.000 --> 19:15.400
that the three-way stabbing iconic scene

19:15.400 --> 19:16.860
is unavoidable after all?

19:16.940 --> 19:18.560
You killed my father

19:18.680 --> 19:19.790
and stole my bride.

19:20.550 --> 19:22.200
Today I'll settle

19:22.200 --> 19:23.530
all these scores at once

19:23.690 --> 19:25.270
and end your life, monster!

19:26.070 --> 19:27.400
You want to take me down?

19:27.880 --> 19:30.080
Let's see if you’re capable of doing so.

19:36.570 --> 19:37.740
No, no.

19:38.110 --> 19:39.440
Stay calm, Song Yimeng.

19:39.680 --> 19:41.140
If you go out there now,

19:41.240 --> 19:42.960
the three-way stabbing iconic scene

19:42.960 --> 19:44.490
will definitely happen.

19:44.920 --> 19:46.520
I can't go out there. I can't.

20:04.570 --> 20:05.550
I'm doomed.

20:11.270 --> 20:12.070
Song Yimeng,

20:12.070 --> 20:12.880
Yimeng.

20:15.070 --> 20:15.800
General Chu.

20:15.850 --> 20:16.890
General Chu.

20:17.110 --> 20:18.180
I've made up my mind.

20:18.180 --> 20:19.460
I've made up my mind.

20:19.590 --> 20:21.610
Why do you have to keep pushing me?

20:21.790 --> 20:23.650
Why do you have to keep pushing me?

20:24.240 --> 20:25.050
Song Yimeng.

20:25.070 --> 20:25.870
Go back now.

20:26.580 --> 20:27.380
Yimeng.

20:28.080 --> 20:29.690
How can I stand by and watch you

20:29.690 --> 20:31.480
marry a murderous fiend

20:31.550 --> 20:32.860
and throw your life away

20:32.860 --> 20:34.240
like this?

20:35.640 --> 20:37.170
So what if he's murderous?

20:37.350 --> 20:38.810
So what if he's a fiend?

20:39.640 --> 20:41.480
Even if loving him is a mistake,

20:41.480 --> 20:42.400
I'm willing to make it.

20:42.400 --> 20:43.000
I'm willing

20:43.000 --> 20:44.750
to make the mistake repeatedly,

20:44.750 --> 20:45.720
again and again!

20:45.720 --> 20:46.650
again and again!

20:46.960 --> 20:47.960
Yimeng!

20:48.070 --> 20:48.800
Song Yimeng.

20:49.200 --> 20:50.370
Song Yimeng.

20:50.440 --> 20:51.790
Get back into the palanquin.

20:51.790 --> 20:52.590
Song Yimeng.

20:53.030 --> 20:53.880
Nan Heng!

20:54.160 --> 20:55.030
Let her go!

21:17.440 --> 21:18.350
Fugui,

21:18.350 --> 21:19.480
strike!

21:39.480 --> 21:40.760
It worked.

21:48.470 --> 21:49.650
Nan Heng.

22:08.720 --> 22:09.920
Nan Heng,

22:10.160 --> 22:11.180
Nan Heng.

22:11.640 --> 22:12.440
Seize him.

22:12.480 --> 22:13.270
Yes.

22:15.790 --> 22:16.720
Someone help!

22:16.750 --> 22:17.440
Fugui,

22:17.470 --> 22:18.830
quickly get the royal physician,

22:18.830 --> 22:19.550
hurry!

22:21.790 --> 22:22.760
Nan Heng.

22:26.590 --> 22:27.310
Nan Heng,

22:27.330 --> 22:28.430
Nan Heng.

22:30.400 --> 22:32.290
Nan Heng, hold on a little longer.

22:32.310 --> 22:33.880
The physician will be here soon,

22:33.880 --> 22:34.510
alright?

22:36.920 --> 22:38.220
Just hold on.

22:38.990 --> 22:44.500
♪ The mortal world entangles,
so much sorrow and chill in the mist ♪

22:40.270 --> 22:41.070
I'm fine.

22:41.290 --> 22:42.170
I'm fine.

22:44.480 --> 22:45.270
You see?

22:47.510 --> 22:48.570
Destiny

22:47.900 --> 22:53.420
♪ Our fates intertwine and weave
into a story ♪

22:48.920 --> 22:50.200
can be changed.

22:51.060 --> 22:52.150
I believe you.

22:52.960 --> 22:54.590
I believe everything you say.

22:54.590 --> 22:55.830
I believe you.

22:55.390 --> 22:58.930
♪ Listening to the wind whispering
by my ear ♪

22:56.050 --> 22:57.030
Hold on,

22:57.030 --> 22:57.750
Nan Heng.

22:57.770 --> 22:58.750
Nan Heng.

22:58.770 --> 22:59.750
Nan Heng!

23:00.620 --> 23:02.910
♪ The schemes of the dark night ♪

23:02.380 --> 23:03.220
Nan Heng.

23:03.930 --> 23:04.710
Nan Heng.

23:04.440 --> 23:08.470
♪ Eyes guarding a single sunrise ♪

23:04.970 --> 23:05.830
I believe you.

23:05.830 --> 23:06.550
Nan Heng,

23:06.990 --> 23:08.720
please hold on a little longer.

23:09.740 --> 23:12.630
♪ When will there be a way home? ♪

23:09.920 --> 23:10.720
Listen to me.

23:10.750 --> 23:12.780
Open your eyes and look at me,

23:12.850 --> 23:14.040
will you?

23:13.780 --> 23:17.020
♪ Time brings life and death, binding life
but not the heart ♪

23:14.070 --> 23:15.110
Nan Heng.

23:15.880 --> 23:16.640
Nan Heng!

23:18.440 --> 23:21.690
♪ Stepping into the ranks of fate,
each pain a prelude ♪

23:23.310 --> 23:26.820
♪ Transformed in a fleeting moment,
like a dream, elusive and near ♪

23:27.750 --> 23:31.280
♪ How can love and hate be hidden? ♪

23:32.340 --> 23:35.110
♪ Time brings life and death, binding life
but not the heart ♪

23:36.340 --> 23:40.090
♪ Making all moves in life cautiously,
joy and sorrow already destined ♪

23:37.400 --> 23:38.200
Nan Heng.

23:39.800 --> 23:41.030
What should I do?

23:41.070 --> 23:42.440
Nan Heng. Nan Heng.

23:41.840 --> 23:45.350
♪ If one dares oppose Heaven,
how can the ending be rewritten? ♪

23:42.480 --> 23:43.270
Nan Heng.

23:43.480 --> 23:44.830
Listen to me.

23:44.960 --> 23:45.920
You can't die,

23:45.920 --> 23:46.960
do you hear me?

23:46.810 --> 23:48.960
We're so close, we're still

23:47.070 --> 23:48.440
You can't die!

23:50.380 --> 23:53.880
♪ Time brings life and death, binding life
but not the heart ♪

23:51.880 --> 23:53.750
Didn't you promise me?

23:54.350 --> 23:55.680
You said you could solve

23:55.750 --> 23:57.420
all the things I worry about.

23:55.890 --> 23:58.660
♪ Stepping into the ranks of fate,
each pain a prelude ♪

23:59.750 --> 24:01.460
Now, I just need you to survive.

24:00.030 --> 24:03.240
♪ Transformed in a fleeting moment,
like a dream, elusive and near ♪

24:01.590 --> 24:02.510
Do you hear me?

24:02.510 --> 24:04.220
I just need you alive.

24:04.310 --> 24:07.690
♪ How can love and hate be hidden? ♪

24:04.640 --> 24:06.160
Wake up, Nan Heng,

24:06.160 --> 24:07.640
Please wake up, will you?

24:07.660 --> 24:08.800
Help!

24:08.800 --> 24:11.680
♪ Time brings life and death, binding life
but not the heart ♪

24:08.830 --> 24:10.110
Someone come quickly!

24:12.190 --> 24:13.900
Help! Someone!

24:12.600 --> 24:16.580
♪ Making all moves in life cautiously,
joy and sorrow already destined ♪

24:18.750 --> 24:20.890
Where is the royal physician?

24:19.110 --> 24:22.020
♪ If one dares oppose Heaven,
how can the ending be rewritten? ♪

24:23.000 --> 24:24.080
Nan Heng.

24:23.140 --> 24:30.260
♪ So close yet still, we part ways ♪

24:24.480 --> 24:27.130
Please don't leave me alone, will you?

24:27.160 --> 24:28.470
I'm begging you!

24:28.780 --> 24:30.420
I'm begging you!

24:30.440 --> 24:31.330
Nan Heng!

24:31.810 --> 24:33.400
Nan Heng!

24:32.310 --> 24:35.530
♪ If one dares oppose Heaven,
how can the ending be rewritten? ♪

24:33.740 --> 24:35.370
Nan Heng!

24:37.090 --> 24:44.060
♪ So close yet still, we part ways ♪

24:53.350 --> 24:56.470
His Highness has been stabbed twice
in the vital areas,

24:56.640 --> 24:59.350
I'm afraid there's nothing we can do.

25:01.680 --> 25:02.480
Nan Heng.

25:03.750 --> 25:06.010
They all say you won't survive the night,

25:08.000 --> 25:08.960
but I don't care.

25:10.240 --> 25:13.100
You were the one who desperately begged
to marry me.

25:13.590 --> 25:14.400
Today,

25:15.350 --> 25:17.010
whether you're alive or dead,

25:17.800 --> 25:20.460
you must complete the wedding ceremony
with me.

25:22.240 --> 25:24.100
After drinking this wedding cup,

25:25.510 --> 25:27.370
we will truly be husband and wife.

25:29.590 --> 25:30.850
From this day forward,

25:31.830 --> 25:33.510
for richer or for poorer,

25:34.350 --> 25:35.830
in sickness or in health,

25:37.030 --> 25:38.440
I will never leave you.

25:39.240 --> 25:40.030
Of course,

25:40.750 --> 25:42.210
you can't leave me either.

25:43.640 --> 25:45.500
If you have any conscience at all,

25:46.490 --> 25:48.220
you'd better wake up right now.

25:55.370 --> 25:56.960
All I hope now is

25:57.720 --> 25:59.250
that fate will be kind to me,

26:00.890 --> 26:02.680
allowing me to stay

26:03.270 --> 26:04.930
in your world a little longer.

26:09.530 --> 26:10.460
Or perhaps,

26:13.030 --> 26:14.350
maybe I can find a way

26:15.290 --> 26:17.270
to bring you into my world,

26:19.200 --> 26:20.330
how does that sound?

26:24.270 --> 26:25.350
Nan Heng,

26:28.070 --> 26:30.050
please wake up soon, will you?

26:31.680 --> 26:33.030
If you can just wake up,

26:35.430 --> 26:37.360
I won't ask for a big house anymore.

26:38.640 --> 26:39.790
I don't want any

26:40.090 --> 26:41.620
cats or dogs,

26:42.160 --> 26:43.160
milk puppies,

26:43.180 --> 26:44.090
wolf puppies,

26:44.120 --> 26:46.210
I just want you, you silly dog.

26:49.440 --> 26:51.370
Did you hear me?

26:55.840 --> 26:57.090
Let me tell you,

26:56.800 --> 27:01.930
♪ I leave the book aside,
though I haven't finished reading it ♪

26:58.400 --> 27:00.950
I'm only giving you this one night.

27:01.340 --> 27:03.180
Before tomorrow morning,

27:03.960 --> 27:05.720
if you don't wake up,

27:05.540 --> 27:11.230
♪ I know one day I can have
a glimpse of the ending ♪

27:05.880 --> 27:06.680
I'll...

27:07.720 --> 27:09.280
I'll finish you off myself.

27:09.530 --> 27:11.190
Once you're completely dead,

27:11.190 --> 27:13.080
I'll inherit all your property

27:13.240 --> 27:14.960
and turn around and marry someone else,

27:14.360 --> 27:18.480
♪ Life is unpredictable ♪

27:14.980 --> 27:16.100
driving you so mad!

27:17.790 --> 27:19.030
Did you hear me?

27:19.310 --> 27:22.190
♪ Who can get rid of perplexity ♪

27:21.680 --> 27:23.380
Wake up soon.

27:23.210 --> 27:27.780
♪ And find the answer he yearns for? ♪

27:31.810 --> 27:34.920
♪ Let the wind flip through
the past chapters of my life ♪

27:36.260 --> 27:39.460
♪ Let brush and ink
depict my adventures ♪

27:40.770 --> 27:47.130
♪ Let's see in how many ways
fate can shape my life ♪

27:49.760 --> 27:53.100
♪ Let moonlight shine on
the lines about love and hate ♪

27:54.190 --> 27:57.470
♪ Let me bang my head
against a brick wall ♪

27:58.730 --> 28:04.960
♪ If this is my destiny,
I'll accept it ♪

28:01.540 --> 28:02.910
What are you good for?

28:03.090 --> 28:04.450
What are you all good for?

28:04.450 --> 28:06.400
Say once more that His Highness cannot be saved,

28:06.400 --> 28:08.480
and you shall all be held accountable.

28:08.480 --> 28:10.550
Even if it was the most experienced
royal physician,

28:10.550 --> 28:11.880
he would be powerless in this situation.

28:11.880 --> 28:12.700
Nonsense!

28:13.440 --> 28:15.400
His Highness is blessed by heaven.

28:15.500 --> 28:17.050
What rubbish are you talking?

28:17.050 --> 28:18.020
Fugui,

28:18.240 --> 28:19.350
calm down.

28:19.950 --> 28:20.880
Eighteenth Prince,

28:20.880 --> 28:21.550
Eighteenth Prince,

28:21.550 --> 28:22.480
why are you here?

28:22.660 --> 28:24.090
I'm here to save Heng.

28:24.240 --> 28:25.030
Oh, right.

28:25.290 --> 28:27.030
He's Doctor Zhao from the Qianyu Army.

28:27.030 --> 28:27.890
Let him try.

28:27.920 --> 28:28.960
I heard from Guihong that

28:28.960 --> 28:29.880
at the border,

28:29.880 --> 28:30.880
Doctor Zhao was the one who

28:30.880 --> 28:32.070
reattached broken arms.

28:32.070 --> 28:34.350
His Highness is now fighting for his life.

28:34.350 --> 28:36.380
It's not as simple as a broken limb.

28:36.400 --> 28:37.030
Besides,

28:37.510 --> 28:39.440
he can't even reattach his own arm.

28:39.550 --> 28:41.270
On what grounds should he treat
His Highness?

28:41.270 --> 28:42.070
Fugui,

28:42.240 --> 28:43.240
think carefully,

28:43.240 --> 28:45.030
why did I come all this way
in the dead of night?

28:45.030 --> 28:46.690
I sincerely want to save Heng.

28:46.750 --> 28:48.330
Just let him take a look.

28:48.750 --> 28:50.960
Even if the Eighteenth Prince
genuinely wants to help,

28:50.960 --> 28:52.240
you should be aware

28:52.440 --> 28:53.590
that today's assassination attempt

28:53.590 --> 28:55.320
was carried out by Chu Guihong.

28:55.510 --> 28:56.310
And he

28:56.480 --> 28:57.920
is from the Qianyu Army.

28:59.350 --> 29:01.030
If he harms His Highness,

29:01.110 --> 29:02.440
who will take the responsibility?

29:02.440 --> 29:03.900
Sir, please rest assured,

29:04.640 --> 29:07.100
the reason I'm willing to treat
His Highness

29:07.510 --> 29:10.630
is to atone for Junior General's sins.

29:16.960 --> 29:18.390
I ask for your promise

29:18.710 --> 29:20.660
that if I could heal His Highness,

29:20.720 --> 29:22.820
after he wakes up,

29:23.030 --> 29:24.230
he will

29:24.270 --> 29:26.160
pardon my Junior General's

29:26.400 --> 29:27.800
assassination attempt.

29:28.550 --> 29:31.080
What kind of scums are you
Qianyu Army people!

29:31.550 --> 29:34.030
His Highness is currently
between life and death,

29:34.030 --> 29:36.310
and you're trying to take advantage
of the situation.

29:36.310 --> 29:37.270
Let me tell you,

29:37.300 --> 29:38.310
what Chu Guihong did

29:38.310 --> 29:40.290
was a treasonous crime against
the sovereignty.

29:40.290 --> 29:42.200
He deserves to be executed by
a thousand cuts!

29:42.200 --> 29:43.550
If you don't agree,

29:44.440 --> 29:45.700
I'll take my leave now.

29:46.260 --> 29:47.270
Fugui, you...

29:47.270 --> 29:47.750
Wait, wait, wait.

29:47.750 --> 29:48.720
Doctor Zhao. Doctor Zhao.

29:48.720 --> 29:49.200
Fugui.

29:49.220 --> 29:50.150
Seriously.

29:50.200 --> 29:51.030
At a time like this,

29:51.030 --> 29:53.030
couldn't you just agree to it first?

29:53.400 --> 29:54.240
I agree.

29:59.030 --> 30:00.230
I agree to your terms.

30:01.510 --> 30:03.240
-Her Highness.
-Her Highness.

30:04.880 --> 30:07.200
Today I married into the Crown Prince's
household,

30:07.200 --> 30:09.030
and all matters in this household

30:09.030 --> 30:10.510
should be decided by me.

30:11.880 --> 30:12.720
I promise you.

30:14.640 --> 30:16.570
As long as Nan Heng wakes up safely,

30:17.260 --> 30:18.240
he and I

30:18.920 --> 30:21.410
will not pursue Chu Guihong's crime.

30:21.480 --> 30:22.270
Good.

30:23.160 --> 30:23.960
Wait.

30:24.480 --> 30:25.530
But if

30:26.270 --> 30:27.830
you fail to save him.

30:29.310 --> 30:32.570
I will not only have Your Majesty
punish him for his crimes,

30:33.440 --> 30:34.440
but I won't let go

30:35.490 --> 30:37.090
every single one of you

30:38.270 --> 30:39.830
in the Qianyu Army,

30:42.790 --> 30:43.650
including you,

30:45.530 --> 30:46.830
Eighteenth Prince.

30:48.910 --> 30:51.320
[A village in the suburb]

30:50.540 --> 30:51.640
Is everyone here?

30:51.640 --> 30:52.880
Yes, all present.

30:52.880 --> 30:53.480
These men

30:53.480 --> 30:56.030
are soldiers serving the Crown Prince.

30:56.400 --> 30:59.260
They're hunting for the assassin
in this portrait.

30:59.560 --> 31:00.670
Everyone take a look.

31:00.670 --> 31:01.780
Can you all see it?

31:02.000 --> 31:05.000
Whoever finds the assassin
who attempted to kill the Crown Prince

31:05.000 --> 31:07.000
will be rewarded one hundred taels.

31:07.030 --> 31:08.340
One hundred taels.

31:08.480 --> 31:09.270
Let's go,

31:09.270 --> 31:10.090
Hurry up.

31:10.110 --> 31:11.000
Hurry up.

31:11.000 --> 31:12.350
Go, go!

31:12.680 --> 31:13.920
Search thoroughly!

31:14.550 --> 31:15.640
Look carefully!

31:15.370 --> 31:17.340
[Peace & Prosperity]

31:15.720 --> 31:16.830
Hurry, hurry!

31:35.960 --> 31:36.750
Over there!

31:36.750 --> 31:37.510
Brothers,

31:37.510 --> 31:38.110
after him!

31:38.110 --> 31:39.270
-Go after them!
-Over there!

31:39.270 --> 31:40.790
-Get him!
-Stop right there!

31:40.790 --> 31:42.440
-Stop right there!
-Don't run!

31:42.440 --> 31:43.350
Stop!

31:43.480 --> 31:44.110
Stop!

31:44.140 --> 31:45.000
Stop!

31:45.700 --> 31:46.710
Stop!

31:47.310 --> 31:48.290
Stop running!

32:22.270 --> 32:23.240
How's it going?

32:37.110 --> 32:39.820
[Modern suturing technique:
Interrupted suture]

33:01.400 --> 33:04.050
[Seventh Prince's Mansion]

33:16.740 --> 33:17.600
Your Highness,

33:17.750 --> 33:19.210
the morning air is chilly,

33:19.270 --> 33:20.870
please put on another layer.

33:25.240 --> 33:26.110
Fugui,

33:26.200 --> 33:27.310
Strike.

33:37.370 --> 33:38.230
Your Highness,

33:38.270 --> 33:39.720
perhaps you should rest inside.

33:39.720 --> 33:40.920
I'll keep watch here.

33:40.940 --> 33:41.660
Fugui,

33:42.070 --> 33:43.400
what made you decide

33:43.400 --> 33:45.260
to stab me with a sword yesterday?

33:47.820 --> 33:50.410
[The night before the wedding]

33:53.110 --> 33:54.770
Tomorrow during the wedding,

33:55.070 --> 33:57.110
if Chu Guihong appears to assassinate,

33:57.110 --> 33:58.830
and things get out of control,

33:59.030 --> 34:00.400
follow my signal

34:01.030 --> 34:03.190
and stab Song Yimeng with your sword.

34:03.400 --> 34:04.260
Your Highness,

34:04.270 --> 34:05.530
why would you ask this?

34:08.880 --> 34:10.440
If Miss Song is in danger,

34:10.469 --> 34:12.190
Your Highness will step in to save her,

34:12.190 --> 34:13.719
won't you be the one getting hurt?

34:13.719 --> 34:14.590
I cannot do this.

34:14.590 --> 34:16.320
You must do it even if you think
you can't.

34:16.320 --> 34:17.150
In this matter,

34:17.150 --> 34:18.330
I trust only you,

34:18.670 --> 34:20.409
and only you can carry it out.

34:28.110 --> 34:29.570
Using the mechanism where

34:30.880 --> 34:33.940
the male lead must save the female lead
in times of danger

34:33.940 --> 34:37.070
he defeated mechanism where
iconic scenes must happen.

34:41.440 --> 34:42.840
So he had already

34:45.210 --> 34:47.270
anticipated all possible accidents

34:47.510 --> 34:48.710
and countermeasures

34:49.840 --> 34:51.159
the night before.

34:53.150 --> 34:54.280
His Highness was...

34:55.960 --> 34:57.920
Risking his life to prove to you

34:59.220 --> 35:00.820
that he deserves your trust.

35:11.360 --> 35:12.150
Miss.

35:12.480 --> 35:13.460
Miss.

35:14.360 --> 35:15.150
Miss.

35:15.480 --> 35:16.070
Yiting.

35:16.070 --> 35:16.710
Yiting.

35:17.280 --> 35:18.410
Why are you all here?

35:19.030 --> 35:20.030
It's all my fault,

35:20.150 --> 35:22.030
I failed to keep an eye on Chu Guihong.

35:22.030 --> 35:22.750
How is he?

35:24.440 --> 35:26.150
The Qianyu Army's physician, Dr. Zhao,

35:26.150 --> 35:27.680
is treating his wounds now.

35:28.070 --> 35:29.000
Dr. Zhao.

35:31.480 --> 35:32.110
Yiting.

35:32.230 --> 35:33.590
Please don't misunderstand.

35:33.590 --> 35:34.980
He's not Guihong's accomplice,

35:34.980 --> 35:36.380
he's someone I brought here.

35:36.380 --> 35:37.510
Eighteenth Prince,

35:37.840 --> 35:39.590
when the assassination happened yesterday,

35:39.590 --> 35:42.150
why did you arrive here so quickly?

35:42.630 --> 35:43.070
I...

35:43.070 --> 35:44.280
Yes, Eighteenth Prince,

35:44.280 --> 35:45.190
how did you know

35:45.190 --> 35:46.760
the royal physicians couldn't save
His Highness,

35:46.760 --> 35:47.510
and

35:47.630 --> 35:49.360
even brought a doctor with you?

35:50.070 --> 35:52.230
Doctor Zhao came to me yesterday.

35:52.250 --> 35:53.770
I learned from him

35:53.800 --> 35:56.260
that Heng was stabbed and
couldn't be saved.

35:57.040 --> 35:58.020
But how could

35:58.040 --> 35:59.650
Doctor Zhao know in advance?

36:01.710 --> 36:03.440
Could it be just a coincidence?

36:10.260 --> 36:12.090
[Happiness]

36:20.220 --> 36:21.260
How is he doing?

36:22.150 --> 36:23.610
The bleeding has stopped.

36:23.770 --> 36:26.040
His Highness's life is considered safe.

36:27.000 --> 36:29.230
As long as he doesn't develop a fever
tonight,

36:29.230 --> 36:31.360
he will have survived this ordeal.

36:31.380 --> 36:32.090
Thank you.

36:32.230 --> 36:33.090
Your Highness,

36:34.630 --> 36:36.590
don't forget our agreement.

36:37.230 --> 36:38.030
Alright.

36:43.480 --> 36:44.590
Doctor Zhao,

36:44.960 --> 36:46.110
about the Crown Prince being stabbed,

36:46.110 --> 36:47.630
how did you know about it?

36:47.710 --> 36:49.440
Someone sent me a message.

36:49.860 --> 36:50.660
Who?

36:52.510 --> 36:53.590
I was brought by the Eighteenth Prince

36:53.590 --> 36:55.500
to treat the Crown Prince.

36:55.530 --> 36:57.950
I cannot answer questions from others.

36:58.110 --> 36:58.840
Doctor Zhao,

36:59.000 --> 37:01.110
I'm quite curious about that too.

37:02.730 --> 37:03.590
Your Highness,

37:04.110 --> 37:05.880
you will know soon enough.

37:07.590 --> 37:08.400
Farewell.

37:13.050 --> 37:15.290
This Chu Guihong is quite bold

37:15.660 --> 37:17.710
to dare assassinating the crown prince.

37:17.710 --> 37:19.420
Now that the crown prince is in a coma,

37:19.420 --> 37:20.650
he vanished.

37:22.090 --> 37:23.080
Your Majesty, please calm your anger.

37:23.080 --> 37:24.290
Father.

37:24.320 --> 37:25.360
Take care of your health,

37:25.360 --> 37:26.070
Father.

37:26.800 --> 37:27.840
Don't be angry.

37:27.840 --> 37:28.880
Does he know that

37:29.670 --> 37:31.370
attempting to assassinate the crown prince

37:31.370 --> 37:34.700
is an offence that condemns nine generations
of his family?

37:34.880 --> 37:37.510
Even if the Empress and Lord Qianyu
were still alive,

37:37.510 --> 37:39.310
they couldn't save his life.

37:39.630 --> 37:40.480
Yes,

37:40.630 --> 37:41.320
Father.

37:41.340 --> 37:43.530
Now that Heng is out of danger,

37:43.560 --> 37:44.480
and Song Yimeng has promised

37:44.480 --> 37:46.070
not to pursue Guihong's crimes anymore.

37:46.070 --> 37:48.480
Perhaps you could give him
a lighter punishment?

37:48.480 --> 37:50.340
The law of the land must be upheld.

37:50.490 --> 37:52.090
An attack on the crown prince

37:52.320 --> 37:53.480
cannot be dismissed by Song Yimeng's

37:53.480 --> 37:55.630
casual words of forgiveness.

37:55.850 --> 37:56.770
Yes, yes, yes.

37:56.790 --> 37:58.180
If Song Yimeng's word doesn't count,

37:58.180 --> 37:59.240
what about Mother?

37:59.320 --> 38:00.400
When Mother was alive,

38:00.400 --> 38:01.780
she loved Guihong the most.

38:01.780 --> 38:02.150
Father,

38:02.150 --> 38:03.610
if you really execute him,

38:03.820 --> 38:05.000
I fear Mother's spirit

38:05.000 --> 38:06.800
will never rest in peace.

38:09.760 --> 38:11.020
Rui, in that case,

38:12.280 --> 38:14.130
send more Imperial Guards to look for him

38:14.130 --> 38:15.530
and bring him back first.

38:16.510 --> 38:17.510
As for the rest,

38:17.840 --> 38:19.170
we'll discuss it later.

38:19.280 --> 38:19.920
Yes,

38:19.920 --> 38:21.320
I'll see to it right away.

38:23.300 --> 38:30.970
[Clear Breeze and a Radiant Moon]

38:25.710 --> 38:27.000
Is the Noble Consort's chamber

38:27.000 --> 38:28.150
this way?

38:40.840 --> 38:41.630
My Lady,

38:42.070 --> 38:43.320
His Highness

38:43.320 --> 38:44.590
is now out of danger

38:44.960 --> 38:46.760
and Yimeng is taking care of him.

38:47.130 --> 38:48.660
You need not worry too much.

38:50.690 --> 38:52.690
You should take care of your health.

38:53.190 --> 38:54.760
Heaven be praised.

38:56.860 --> 38:58.040
Good child.

38:59.030 --> 39:00.550
Thank you for thinking

39:00.570 --> 39:02.430
to inform me.

39:04.710 --> 39:05.810
Your name is

39:06.360 --> 39:08.280
Song Yiting, right?

39:12.280 --> 39:15.270
You're just as likable as your sister.

39:15.510 --> 39:16.890
I find that

39:17.110 --> 39:18.670
Song Yude's second daughter

39:18.670 --> 39:21.070
is more sensible than Song Yimeng.

39:21.640 --> 39:24.300
I, Song Yiting, pay my respects to
Your Majesty.

39:24.340 --> 39:25.060
Careful.

39:25.190 --> 39:25.960
Careful.

39:27.720 --> 39:28.630
Your Majesty.

39:33.710 --> 39:34.840
How old are you?

39:35.550 --> 39:36.360
Your Majesty,

39:36.450 --> 39:38.140
I've just turned 22.

39:39.230 --> 39:40.230
Are you married?

39:42.680 --> 39:44.820
I already have someone I fancy.

39:44.850 --> 39:47.400
Though we haven't formally exchanged
our birth details,

39:47.400 --> 39:49.000
I've already decided on him.

39:49.630 --> 39:50.440
In my eyes,

39:51.030 --> 39:52.830
there's no room for anyone else.

39:53.240 --> 39:55.030
I only asked if you were married,

39:55.030 --> 39:57.560
yet you've given me this
long-winded answer.

39:59.110 --> 39:59.920
Your Majesty,

40:00.100 --> 40:01.360
please don't be angry.

40:01.840 --> 40:03.190
Miss Song Yiting,

40:03.210 --> 40:05.050
like her sister,

40:05.080 --> 40:07.080
is straightforward person.

40:07.320 --> 40:08.840
She speaks

40:08.840 --> 40:11.040
whatever comes to mind without filter.

40:11.710 --> 40:14.190
She meant no disrespect to Your Majesty.

40:14.190 --> 40:15.590
I didn't say anything,

40:15.920 --> 40:16.670
why are you so frightened

40:16.670 --> 40:19.330
that you use the Crown Prince's wife
as a shield?

40:20.150 --> 40:20.960
Well...

40:22.150 --> 40:23.110
I came today

40:23.950 --> 40:25.550
just to see how you are doing.

40:27.190 --> 40:29.400
The Crown Prince is currently recovering.

40:29.400 --> 40:30.860
You need to ease your mind,

40:31.190 --> 40:33.280
and take good care of yourself,

40:33.360 --> 40:35.960
so he won't have to worry about you.

40:36.670 --> 40:37.440
Yes.

40:47.280 --> 40:50.110
[Seventh Prince's Mansion]
